{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13146","headline":"和郑少尹祭中岳寺北访萧居士越上方 · 皇甫冉","name":"和郑少尹祭中岳寺北访萧居士越上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃寺祠灵境，寻真到隐居。\n夤缘幽谷远，萧散白云余。\n晚节持僧律，他年着道书。\n海边曾狎鸟，濠上正观鱼。\n寂静求无相，淳和覩太初。\n一峰绵岁月，万性任盈虚。\n篱隔溪钟度，窗临涧木疎。\n谢公怀旧壑，回驾复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}